/*
 * The catalogue the recommender draws from.
 *
 * Each game has:
 *   id         unique slug, used in shareable links
 *   title      display name
 *   year       release year of this version
 *   series     optional; games in the same series get a small nudge together
 *   platforms  where this version is sold natively (see PLATFORMS below)
 *   hours      rough main-story length, in the spirit of HowLongToBeat's "Main Story" figure
 *   tags       taste tags (see TAGS below); these drive the matching
 *   pitch      one sentence shown on the results card
 *   aka        optional search aliases
 *   starter    optional; widely loved, approachable picks used when there is little to go on
 *   note       optional; shown under the platforms line
 *
 * Backward compatibility is handled in recommend.js, so a PS4 game only needs "ps4"
 * to show up for someone with a PS5, an Xbox One game shows up on Series X|S, and a
 * Switch game shows up on Switch 2.
 */
